  "body": "**Blocked by:** #131\n\n## Context\n\nApprovals are a system responsibility and cannot be hidden inside the originating project.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd one Semprec navigation destination listing all pending requests across projects. Each row shows tool, risk class, safe payload summary, requested time, source project, and source agent-run link, with explicit Approve and Reject actions. Show decided state after races instead of treating a zero-row transition as an error. Provide loading, empty, malformed-payload, and action-error states using shared i18n/client conventions. A notification may link to this list but cannot itself decide.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Global list, source links, safe summaries, decisions, and UI states.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Per-project approval lists, chat/push decisions, and notification transport delivery.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Requests from different projects appear together.\n- A race refreshes to the authoritative decided state.\n- Sensitive credential values are never rendered.\n",
